   codeCpp:`#include <vector>\nusing namespace std;\nint missingNumber(vector<int>& nums) {\n    int n = nums.size(), sum = n * (n + 1) / 2;\n    for (int x : nums) sum -= x;\n    return sum;\n}`,
   codeJava:`public class Solution { public int missingNumber(int[] nums) { int n = nums.length, sum = n * (n + 1) / 2; for (int x : nums) sum -= x; return sum; } }`,
